{"2497090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ghost in the brain/孵る明晰夢", "steam_appid": 2497090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497090/extras/8d2522ebe05f51b3e2c86709a42d642e.avif?t=1766012029\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>You are Yosihide Mizuno, a painter.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have been using the drowned corpse of your younger sister, Misao — who took her own life at a young age — as the subject of your paintings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But lately, you've begun to doubt your own memories.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Was that serene, beautiful face truly what you remember it to be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With your solo exhibition fast approaching, desperation drives you to undergo a strange form of hypnotherapy, said to let you vividly recall your memories—at the recommendation of a certain neurosurgeon.</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■About</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaeru Meisekimu Ghost in the Brain is a psychological horror game set in a world of madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special abilities to survive terrifying encounters with monstrous, otherworldly beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Keyhole Peeking<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497090/extras/289bb1076352a24c80d22e5665ac0035.avif?t=1766012029\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■A World of Mad Memories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within your reconstructed memories lurk horrors beyond imagination:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >giant-eyed creatures, the ghost of a drowned girl,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a butterfly specimen with a girl’s head, and even a flying arowana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve twisted puzzles and gather fragments of memory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while evading these abominations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape this lucid nightmare and reach the truth that lies beneath?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game is still in development. Content is subject to change without notice.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497090/extras/8d2522ebe05f51b3e2c86709a42d642e.avif?t=1766012029\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>You are Yosihide Mizuno, a painter.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have been using the drowned corpse of your younger sister, Misao — who took her own life at a young age — as the subject of your paintings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But lately, you've begun to doubt your own memories.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Was that serene, beautiful face truly what you remember it to be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With your solo exhibition fast approaching, desperation drives you to undergo a strange form of hypnotherapy, said to let you vividly recall your memories—at the recommendation of a certain neurosurgeon.</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■About</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaeru Meisekimu Ghost in the Brain is a psychological horror game set in a world of madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special abilities to survive terrifying encounters with monstrous, otherworldly beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Keyhole Peeking<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497090/extras/289bb1076352a24c80d22e5665ac0035.avif?t=1766012029\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_p